name: The Psychic — must play 5 cards
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Psychic requires you to play 5 cards (not all must score). Ante 1 boss: build
  5-card hands with Splash or high board value.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: ThePsychic
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: Splash
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: FourFingers
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
